# The OG node's environment (docs/og-deployment.md). Copy to /etc/foga/og.env, fill in, chmod 600, owner foga:foga.
# A node holds ONE key — the cell's operator — and nothing else: no owner, guardian, deployer or mnemonic.
# The node refuses to start if its environment carries any of those (src/node/keys.ts), so keep this file to these two lines.

# The wallet's one key (a single-key wallet: signer.key; a --cell wallet: operator.key). Read-only to the foga user.
FOGA_OPERATOR_KEY_FILE=/opt/foga/wallet/signer.key

# A Sepolia RPC the box can reach. Needed only if the cell configuration names no `rpc`; harmless to set either way.
FOGA_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.example-rpc/v2/<your-key>
